AICore port of the upstream OpenPCDet-GGML fused sparse-conv lowering ops:
- ggml_sparse_gather: gather compact neighbor columns (-1 rows become zeros)
- ggml_sparse_scatter_add(_n): scatter-add per-kernel GEMM blocks back into
  the output rows, with optional folded bias (multi-block avoids concat).
OpenPCDet CUDA-ext compact graphs are the only emitters; every other task
graph is unchanged (ops appended at the end of the op enum, ids stable).
